PROJECT: Axie Infinity

## System Architecture

Architecture Type: Appchain (EVM Sidechain) dengan Settlement Layer Ethereum (HIGH) [Whitepaper v1.1, https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/; Ronin Docs Architecture, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/architecture/overview]

Layer 1 Settlement: Ethereum Mainnet (untuk finalitas bridge, keamanan AXS/SLP ERC-20 asli, dan validator set awal) (HIGH) [Ethereum.org, https://ethereum.org/; Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge]

Layer 2 Execution: Ronin Network (EVM-compatible sidechain purpose-built untuk gaming; block time ~3 detik; gas fee near-zero denominated in RON) (HIGH) [Ronin Docs Consensus, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/consensus/overview; Ronin Explorer, https://explorer.roninchain.com/]

Bridge Architecture: Canonical Bridge (Ronin Bridge) — Lock/Mint mechanism dengan validator set multi-sig (threshold signature) untuk transfer aset dua arah (ETH, USDC, AXS, SLP, NFT) antara Ethereum dan Ronin (HIGH) [Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge; CertiK Audit Ronin Bridge, https://www.certik.com/projects/ronin-network]

Cross-chain Messaging: Ronin Bridge contract event-based messaging; tidak menggunakan general message passing (GMP) seperti LayerZero/Wormhole; khusus untuk asset transfer (HIGH) [Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge; Blog Ronin Bridge Post-Mortem, https://blog.roninchain.com/post-mortem-ronin-bridge-exploit]

Oracle Network: Chainlink Price Feeds terintegrasi di Ronin untuk harga AXS, SLP, RON, WETH, USDC (digunakan Katana DEX dan lending protocols); Chainlink VRF untuk randomness game (HIGH) [Chainlink Blog Ronin Integration, https://blog.chain.link/chainlink-price-feeds-ronin-network/; Ronin Docs Oracle, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/oracles/chainlink]

Indexing: The Graph (subgraph Ronin) untuk data on-chain; Ronin Explorer API; Mavis Market Indexer internal untuk NFT metadata (HIGH) [The Graph Ronin, https://thegraph.com/explorer/subgraphs?network=ronin; Ronin Explorer API, https://explorer.roninchain.com/api-docs; Mavis Market Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/marketplace/overview]

Storage: On-chain state di Ronin (EVM storage); NFT metadata (Axie, Land, Item) tersimpan off-chain (IPFS/centralized CDN) dengan hash on-chain; Game state (battle log, breeding) on-chain via smart contract (HIGH) [Axie Docs Game Mechanics, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/game-mechanics/; Ronin Docs Storage, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/architecture/storage]

## Core Components

Component: Ronin Network (Consensus & Execution Layer)
Function: Menjalankan EVM bytecode; memproses transaksi game, DEX, marketplace, bridge; konsensus DPoS dengan RON staking; block production oleh validator set
Status: Live (Mainnet Feb 2021; DPoS upgrade 2023)
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Docs Consensus, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/consensus/overview]; [Ronin Explorer Validators, https://explorer.roninchain.com/validators]; [Blog Ronin PoS Launch, https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-pos-launch]

Component: Ronin Bridge (Canonical Bridge)
Function: Lock/Mint aset antara Ethereum dan Ronin; threshold signature 5-of-9 (legacy PoA) -> 2/3 validator set weight (DPoS); timelag withdraw 24 jam (pasca-exploit); emergency pause mechanism
Status: Live (dengan upgrade keamanan pasca-Maret 2022)
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge]; [Blog Ronin Bridge Reopening, https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-bridge-reopening]; [CertiK Audit, https://www.certik.com/projects/ronin-network]

Component: Katana DEX (AMM)
Function: Constant product AMM (Uniswap v2 style) untuk swap AXS/SLP/RON/WETH/USDC; concentrated liquidity (v3-style) direncanakan; liquidity mining reward RON; protocol fee 0.3% (0.25% LP, 0.05% Treasury)
Status: Live (Agustus 2021)
Sources: (HIGH) [Katana Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/dex/katana]; [Katana UI, https://katana.roninchain.com/]; [Axie Blog Katana Launch, https://axieinfinity.medium.com/katana-dex-is-live-on-ronin-]

Component: Mavis Market (NFT Marketplace)
Function: Orderbook-based NFT marketplace (Seaport-style); protocol fee 4.25% (2.125% Treasury, 2.125% staked AXS); mendukung Axie, Land, Item, RNS; royalties on-chain (ERC-2981)
Status: Live (Juni 2022)
Sources: (HIGH) [Mavis Market Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/marketplace/overview]; [Mavis Market UI, https://marketplace.roninchain.com/]; [Axie Blog Mavis Market, https://axieinfinity.medium.com/mavis-market-is-live-]

Component: Ronin Wallet (Non-custodial Wallet)
Function: Browser extension (Manifest V3) & Mobile (iOS/Android); key management (BIP-44 HD); signing transaksi EIP-1559 (Ronin) & EIP-155 (Ethereum); RNS resolution; hardware wallet support (Ledger)
Status: Live (November 2021)
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Wallet Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/wallet/overview]; [Ronin Wallet Website, https://wallet.roninchain.com/]; [Chrome Web Store, https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/ronin-wallet/]

Component: Axie Infinity Game Protocol (Smart Contracts)
Function: Axie NFT (ERC-721), Land NFT (ERC-721), Item NFT (ERC-1155); Breeding contract (SLP burn + AXS fee); Battle logging (PvP/PvE); Crafting/Alchemy (Homeland); Staking AXS (veAXS/esAXS)
Status: Live (Migrasi ke Ronin 2021; Origins v3 2022; Homeland 2022)
Sources: (HIGH) [Axie Docs Contracts, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/smart-contracts/]; [GitHub Axie Contracts, https://github.com/axieinfinity/axie-contracts]; [Ronin Explorer Axie Contracts, https://explorer.roninchain.com/address/0x...axie...]

Component: Ronin Name Service (RNS)
Function: Naming service (ERC-721 domain .ron); resolver untuk alamat wallet, metadata, avatar; terintegrasi Wallet, Marketplace, dApp; renewal fee tahunan dalam RON
Status: Live (Desember 2022)
Sources: (HIGH) [RNS Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/rns/overview]; [RNS Website, https://rns.roninchain.com/]; [Axie Blog RNS, https://axieinfinity.medium.com/ronin-name-service-rns-is-live-]

Component: Axie Infinity Client (Game Client)
Function: Unity-based client (C#) untuk Origins (PvP/PvE), Homeland (Land sim), Raylights (mini-game); komunikasi ke Ronin via Ronin SDK (REST/GraphQL); local simulation dengan server authoritative validation
Status: Live (Origins 2022; Homeland Alpha 2022; Raylights 2023)
Sources: (HIGH) [Axie Origins Website, https://origins.axieinfinity.com/]; [Axie Homeland Website, https://homeland.axieinfinity.com/]; [GitHub Axie Unity SDK, https://github.com/axieinfinity/unity-sdk]

## Consensus Mechanism

Mechanism: Delegated Proof-of-Stake (DPoS) dengan RON token (sejak upgrade 2023); sebelumnya Proof-of-Authority (PoA) permissioned validator set (2021-2023)
Validator Count: 22 validator aktif (top 22 by stake) + standby validators; epoch ~24 jam; slashing untuk double sign & downtime (belum aktif full slashing per docs 2024)
Block Time: ~3 detik per block; finality ~1 menit (probabilistic, tidak instant finality seperti Tendermint)
Staking Token: RON (native gas & staking); minimum self-stake 250.000 RON untuk kandidat validator; delegasi terbuka untuk pemegang RON
Reward Distribution: Block reward + gas fee → validator → delegator (komisi validator 0-100% disetel validator)
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Docs Consensus, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/consensus/overview]; [Blog Ronin PoS Launch, https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-pos-launch]; [Ronin Explorer Staking, https://explorer.roninchain.com/staking]

## Execution Environment

Environment: EVM-compatible (Ethereum Virtual Machine); mendukung Solidity ^0.8.x; precompile contracts untuk native bridge, staking, RNS; gas fee dalam RON (bukan ETH); chain ID 2020 (Mainnet), 2021 (Testnet Saigon)
Opcode Support: Standar EVM Istanbul/Berlin/London opcodes; tidak mendukung EIP-4844 (blob) karena bukan rollup
Precompiles: 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000100 (Ronin Bridge), 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000200 (Staking), 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000300 (RNS Resolver) — alamat contoh, verifikasi di docs
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Docs EVM Compatibility, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/evm/compatibility]; [Ronin Docs Precompiles, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/evm/precompiles]; [Chainlist Ronin, https://chainlist.org/chain/2020]

