Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Docs Developers, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/developers/overview]; [GitHub Ronin SDK, https://github.com/sky-mavis/ronin-sdk]; [Axie Unity SDK, https://github.com/axieinfinity/unity-sdk]; [Google Cloud Ronin Validator, https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/web3/google-cloud-becomes-ronin-validator]

## Security Model

Validator Security: DPoS dengan 22 validator aktif; staking RON sebagai syarat; slashing condition: double sign (bukti cryptografik) & downtime (missed block threshold); key management: HSM / KMS / Hardware wallet untuk validator kunci
Bridge Security: Threshold signature scheme (TSS) untuk bridge validator set; timelag withdraw 24 jam (user exit window); emergency pause multi-sig (Sky Mavis + community multisig); deposit finality 12 block Ethereum (~3 menit)
Smart Contract Security: Audit wajib pre-mainnet (CertiK, Verichains, PeckShield); bug bounty program (Immunefi — reward hingga $500k untuk critical); formal verification untuk kontrak kritis (bridge, staking) — sebagian
Game Security: Server-authoritative battle simulation (anti-cheat); client-side prediction dengan server reconciliation; anti-bot detection (behavioral analysis, device fingerprint); replay protection
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Docs Security, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/security/overview]; [CertiK Ronin Audit, https://www.certik.com/projects/ronin-network]; [Immunefi Ronin Bug Bounty, https://immunefi.com/bounty/ronin/]; [Blog Ronin Bridge Post-Mortem, https://blog.roninchain.com/post-mortem-ronin-bridge-exploit]; [Axie Docs Anti-Cheat, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/security/anti-cheat/]

