## Current Technical Stack

Infrastructure: Google Cloud Platform (GKE Kubernetes cluster untuk validator node, indexer, API gateway, game server)
Infrastructure: AWS (backup/failover untuk beberapa layanan non-validator)
Node Client: Custom Geth/Erigon fork (Rust/Go) untuk Ronin validator & full node; Docker image distribusi
Indexing: The Graph (Subgraph Ronin) + Custom Indexer (PostgreSQL + Hasura GraphQL) untuk Mavis Market, Katana, Staking Dashboard
Monitoring: Prometheus + Grafana (node metrics); Datadog (infrastructure); Sentry (frontend error tracking)
CI/CD: GitHub Actions (smart contract test/deploy); ArgoCD (Kubernetes deploy); Unity Cloud Build (game client)
Secrets Management: HashiCorp Vault (validator keys, API keys, bridge operator keys)
Database: PostgreSQL (relational data — user, market order, game state cache); Redis (caching, session); ClickHouse (analytics, telemetry)
CDN: Cloudflare (static assets, DDoS protection, Ronin Wallet extension distribution)
Sources: (HIGH) [Google Cloud Ronin Validator, https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/web3/google-cloud-becomes-ronin-validator]; [Ronin Docs Infrastructure, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/running-a-node/infrastructure]; [GitHub Sky Mavis, https://github.com/sky-mavis]; [Ronin Validator Guide, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/running-a-node/validator-guide]

## Known Technical Limitations

Limitation: Throughput terbatas oleh single-threaded EVM execution (~100-200 TPS praktis di Ronin); tidak ada parallel execution (seperti Solana/Sui) atau sharding
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Docs Architecture, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/architecture/overview]; [EVM Performance Benchmarks, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/evm/performance/]

Limitation: Bridge finality tergantung Ethereum L1 (deposit ~3 menit 12 konfirmasi; withdraw 24 jam timelag + Ethereum finality); tidak ada fast finality bridge (seperti ZK bridge atau light client bridge)
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Bridge Docs, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge]; [Blog Ronin Bridge Reopening, https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-bridge-reopening]

Limitation: Validator set permissioned secara historis (PoA 2021-2023); DPoS 2023 membuka tapi top validator tetap didominasi entitas institusional awal; risiko sentralisasi kolusi validator tetap ada
Sources: (HIGH) [Ronin Explorer Validators, https://explorer.roninchain.com/validators]; [Blog Ronin PoS Launch, https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-pos-launch]; [Ronin Governance Forum Decentralization, https://forum.roninchain.com/t/validator-decentralization/]

Limitation: Game client (Unity) bergantung pada server authoritative Sky Mavis untuk battle validation; bukan fully on-chain game logic (hanya state transition on-chain); single point of failure untuk matchmaking & anti-cheat
Sources: (HIGH) [Axie Docs Game Mechanics, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/game-mechanics/]; [Axie Docs Anti-Cheat, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/security/anti-cheat/]

Limitation: NFT metadata (Axie genes, parts, Land resources) tersimpan off-chain (IPFS/Axie CDN); hash on-chain hanya CID; risiko metadata loss jika pinning gagal (meski ada pinning redundan)
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Axie Docs Metadata, https://docs.axieinfinity.com/nft-metadata/]; [IPFS Pinning Services, https://docs.ipfs.tech/how-to/pinning-services/]

Limitation: Tidak ada native account abstraction (ERC-4337) di Ronin Mainnet per 2024; wallet tetap EOA; social recovery / gasless transaction bergantung relayer pihak ketiga (Biconomy, Gelato — integrasi parsial)
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Ronin Docs Account Abstraction, https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/account-abstraction/overview]; [Biconomy Ronin Integration, https://www.biconomy.io/chains/ronin]

